    "title": "Search Intensifies for Missing 29-Year-Old Elijah Douglas in Chicago - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Damon R. Sheffield ,\n3 days ago The Chicago community is being urged to assist in the search for Elijah Douglas, a 29-year-old man reported missing since October 7, 2025. Douglas was last seen in the 5300 block of S. Indiana Ave., and concerns are growing due to his undiagnosed mental health issues. Standing 5'7\" tall and weighing 120 pounds, he has brown eyes, black hair, and a medium brown complexion. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 32",
